window.products.push({"id":150351,"name":"2023 Update 9758079 Bake Oven Spark Igniter for Range by Blutoget - Replacement for Whirlpool Ken-more May-tag Oven Range -Replaces WP9758079 PS117472","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.86,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61n1gLr3M4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Durable High quality Metal √【UPDATE 9758079 OVEN IGNITER】 : WP9758079 Bake Oven Spark Igniter is suitable for range and is a surface burner igniter. Known as a top burner igniter or cooktop spark electrode. Gas stove oven with mounting bracket for whirlpool oven igniter WP9758079. WP9758079 whirlpool oven igniter used to generate sparks or ignite the gas used to ignite oven burners or surface burners or some gas stove models with DSI (direct spark ignition) systems. PS11747217 whirlpool igniter is made of high quality materials, strong and durable. √【GREAT VALUE PACK】 :Includes 1 x 9758079 Oven Igniter. WP9758079 oven igniter is design improved for more durability, Stable and updated characteristics.Range igniter AP6013984 is made from a combination of upgraded high quality ceramics and metal, high reliability,wear-resistant, long-lasting and effective performance. Save money and time. PS11747217 ignitor can solve these problems that will Not Start,gas igniter glows, but will not light and little to no heat when baking.Choose PS11747217 whirlpool igniter can solve your problems. √【REPLACEMENT PART No.】: WP9758079 Bake Oven Spark Igniter is designed to fit specific manufactured range oven models including Whirlpool, Amana, Jenn Air, Ken-more, Magic Chef and Maytag.Replaces WP9758079, 9758079, WP9758079VP, 1028462, PD00002406, AP6013984, PS11747217, EAP11747217 etc. If you are not sure if it is suitable for your model, we will be happy to help you. √【FIT MODELS】 : Oven igniter WP9758079 AP6013984 widely compatible for SF362lXSS0, SF368LEOS2, WEG515S0FS0, AGR6303MFS0, WFG530S0ES1, WEG515S0FS2, WEG515S0FV1, WFG525S0HV1, 66475113611, 66572163301, 66572163302, 66572164301, 66572164302, 66572169301, TGS325VB1, TGS325VB2, TGS325VT0, TGS325VT1, TGS325VT2, TGS326TD0, TGS326TD1, AGR6603SFB2, AGR6603SFS2, AGR6603SFW2, IGR660GS0, IGS790GS0, MGR6600FB1, MGR6600FW1, MGR6600FZ1, WEG515S0FB2, WEG515S0FV2, WEG515S0FW2, WFG510S0HB1, WFG510S0HW1, WFG525S0HB1, WFG525S0HS1 etc. √【365 DAYS GUARANTEE】: Risk-free shopping, 9758079 Range Bake Igniter supports 365 DAYS return and exchange. We promise to ensure your absolute satisfaction with every purchase. If you have any quality problem during warranty period about PS11747217 ignitor, please contact customer service in time. We will try our best to solve the problem. Customer satisfaction is our tireless pursuit. √【EASY TO INSTALL】: Be sure to disconnect the power turn your gas shut-off valve to OFF. Wear work gloves.Locate the location where the ignition is located and use a screwdriver to remove the screw holding the ignition in place. Pull out the igniter. Insert the new igniter into the original position and secure it with the screw, making sure the igniter does not come off and wobble.The installation may require the removal of the access panel on the rear of the stove to disconnect the old ignitor from the wiring harness. You will also need to remove your oven racks, and the floor of the oven from inside to access the ignitor.You can also follow the online maintenance video for assembly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61n1gLr3M4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Blutoget","source_asin":"B08RD9FKHC","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-150351","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08RD9FKHC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08RD9FKHC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
