window.products.push({"id":150613,"name":"W10721967 Washer Pulley Clutch Kit Whirlpool Maytag Drive Splutch Cam Part AP5951296 W10239973 PS10057144 MVWC400XW4 MVWC415EW1 MVWC450XW3 MVWC565FW0 ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.73,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51v4zNVJrLS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💡 W10721967 Whirlpool Drive Clutch Kits - An equivalent for parts AP5951296, W10006356, W10315818, 3319979, PS10057144, W10006352, W10006353, W10006354, W10326374, W10536113, W10721967VP, W10818965. W10721967 Splutch Cam Kit is compatible with Whirlpool, Admiral, Amana, Crosley, Inglis, Kenmore, Maytag, Roper. W10721967 Whirlpool Washer Clutch Kit is responsible for controlling the spin speed of the washer drum during the spin cycle. Amana W10721967 Kit can be installed in a few minutes. 🔧 DIY eTips Included - Not sure how to replace the part? Helpful information can be found on the page below. Scroll down to get more repair tips. Acquire valuable skills during the DIY repair project. Kenmore W10721967 Washer Kit will help if your appliance is noisy, does not agitate, pumps but does not spin, or spins slowly. To repair the clutch assembly of your washer, you need to access the bottom of the machine. It is important to disconnect the washer from water and power sources. 💡 Whirlpool W10721967 Kit includes several components that work together to provide optimal performance. Whirlpool Part W10721967 allows the washer to transition from the agitate cycle to the spin cycle smoothly and efficiently. The clutch assembly is made up of several parts, including the Spring, Housing, Cam Ring, Basket Drive Gear, Pulley and Nut. W10721967 Whirlpool Cam Kit meets or exceeds all manufacturer specifications. We provide a lifetime warranty and guarantee 100% money back. 💡 Can the washing machine operate without the W10721967 Drive Clutch Kit? No, the washing machine cannot operate without a functioning clutch assembly, such as the W10721967 Clutch Kit. Amana Washer Part w10721967 is an essential component of the washing machine's spin cycle, as it controls the transition from the agitate cycle to the spin cycle and determines the spin speed of the drum. Without a properly functioning clutch, the washer will not be able to spin properly or at all. 💡 Is it worth replacing clutch assembly on washing machine? The decision to replace the clutch assembly in a washing machine depends on several factors, including the machine's age and condition, the cost of the replacement part, and the cost of labor for installation. If the machine is relatively new and in good condition, it may be worth replacing the clutch assembly. However, if the machine is older or has other issues, it may be more cost-effective to purchase a new machine.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51v4zNVJrLS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PartsBroz","source_asin":"B07VJFV7QB","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-150613","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VJFV7QB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VJFV7QB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
