window.products.push({"id":150701,"name":"XDS Ice Maker Countertop, Self-Cleaning Ice Maker with Ice Scoop and Basket, Make 27 Lbs Ice in 24 hrs, 9 Ice Cubes Rready in 6-8 Mins, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613J6WM6z8L._SL1500_.jpg","description":"[FAST ICE MAKING] This Ice Maker only takes 6-8 minutes to make 9 bullet-shaped ice cubes. Fill 1.5L of water into the water tank, maximum ice capacity can reach 27 pounds in 24 hours. You can also see the ice making process through the transparent lid. [EASY TO USE] This Ice Maker has the advanced infrared sensor technology; when the ice basket is full, the Ice Maker will stop ice making to prevent ice from overflowing; when the water is insufficient, the indicator also reminds you to replenish water in time. [EASY TO CLEAN] You only need to press the on/off button for 5 seconds to activate the ice maker self-cleaning function. It would be better to add water and vinegar, or citric acid (ratio: 10:1) for cleaning. [WIDE APPLICATIONS] With a portable and compact design measuring 8.5*12.2*11.4 inches, our Countertop Ice Maker is easy to carry and operate. Whenever and wherever you are, ice is there. You can use it for kitchen, office, bar, camping or RV. (the noise is lower than 35dB) [2 SIZES OF ICE CUBES] There are two ice cube sizes for your choice. Large ice cubes are suitable for chilling seafood and beer to keep it fresh and cold. Small ice cubes are more suitable for beverages to achieve a rapid cooling effect.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613J6WM6z8L._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"XDS","source_asin":"B09VGV89CG","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-150701","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09VGV89CG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09VGV89CG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
