window.products.push({"id":150731,"name":"Beaquicy AEZ73453509 Gas Stove Control Knob Replacement for L-G Ken-More G-E Gas Stove - Replaces AEZ72909007 AEZ72909008 AEZ72909013 AP5669773-1 Year","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":31.77,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71c4sC0LGjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【𝑷𝑹𝑶𝑫𝑼𝑪𝑻 𝑫𝑬𝑺𝑪𝑹𝑰𝑷𝑻𝑰𝑶𝑵】: The Oven Range Stove Knob AEZ73453509 can control the heat of the burner on the surface of the stove and is for range. The bottom is a D-shaped shaft, the interface added a metal ring to prevent damage to the installation interface. The first time to use, the knob is a little tight, can not easily push in, then you can add a little lubricant, in the case of the correct model, this is a normal phenomenon, in order to prevent the knob in the process of use. 【𝑴𝑨𝑻𝑬𝑹𝑰𝑨𝑳】: Gas Range Stove Knobs AEZ73453509 are made of durable and heat-resistant high-quality stainless steel. The knob is electroplated to prolong the service life of the product. Non-OEM parts, but meet OEM manufacturing requirements. The size of the knob is about 2.1 inches high x 2.4 inches wide and weighs 1.19 ounces. The inside diameter of the D-shaped hole measures 0.21 inches. The package includes 5 x AEZ73453509 Burner Control Knob. 【𝟑𝟔𝟓 𝑫𝑨𝒀𝑺 𝑾𝑨𝑹𝑹𝑨𝑵𝑻𝒀】: AEZ73453509 Oven Range Stove Knob supports 365 days return and exchange. If you have any quality problem during warranty period, please contact customer service in time. If knob is broken, the stove will have the following conditions, and the knob need to be replaced in time: ★Unable to turn; ★Unable to adjust; ★Range will not set ; ★Can not stay on; ★Will not start. 【𝑾𝑰𝑫𝑬 𝑪𝑶𝑴𝑷𝑨𝑻𝑰𝑩𝑰𝑳𝑬】: The AEZ73453509 Range Burner Control Knob can replacement for L-G stove oven range. ★Replaces Numbers: AP5669773, PS7321756, 2347547, AEZ72909008, LDG3011ST, LDG3016ST/00, LDG3015ST, LDG3015ST/00, LDG3016ST, LDG3017ST, LDG3017ST/00, LDG3031ST, LDG3036BD/00, LRG3061BD/00, LDG3037ST, LDG3037ST/00, LDG3035ST, LDG3036ST/00, LDG3036ST/01, LRG3060ST, LRG3060ST/00, LRG3061ST/01, LRG3081BD/00, LRG3081ST/00, LRG3081ST/01, LRG3083ST/00, LRG3085ST/00, LRG3091ST, LRG3091ST/03, LRG3093ST/02, LRG3193ST/00, LRG3194ST/00, etc. 【𝑩𝑹𝑰𝑵𝑮 𝑪𝑶𝑵𝑽𝑬𝑵𝑰𝑬𝑵𝑪𝑬 𝑭𝑶𝑹 𝒀𝑶𝑼𝑹 𝑳𝑰𝑭𝑬】: The installation of AEZ73453509 Burner Control Knob is simple. Wear work gloves to protect your hands. No tools are required, simply slide the knob straight off the stem and then slide the replacement knob back onto the stem. Be careful not to bend the knob up or down when sliding. You can also find the installation video on YouTube for replacement. A simple installation in a few minutes can save you a lot of money on replacing the stove or hiring a mechanic.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71c4sC0LGjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaquicy","source_asin":"B08C27XFFJ","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-150731","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08C27XFFJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08C27XFFJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
