window.products.push({"id":150894,"name":"Digital Hygrometer, Indoor Thermometer with Touchscreen and Backlight, Temperature Humidity Monitor for Home Office Bedroom Warehouse Basement（Blue）","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MVuYIw75L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"1.Temperature Measuring range:-10℃-50℃ (14℉-122℉) 2.Humidity Measuring range:10%-98%RH 3.Tempererature resolution:0.1℃（0.2℉ ） 4.Humidity resolution:1%RH 5.Analyze degree:0.1℃,1%RH 6.Accurate precision:±1℃,±5%RH Instructions: MODE 1.Press once to switch the display time and the alarm time (two dots without flashing) 2.Time and Date setting When displaying the time mode,press and hold 2 seconds to enter time setting,set the minute,hour,12/24 hour mode,month,day.During the time digits flash ,press“ADJ”to adjust. When completed a set,and then press the“MODE”key once,the next one will be automatically set.If one minute without any key operation,it will automatically exit setup,and finish setting. 3.Alarm setting When displaying the alarm time (AL) mode,press and hold 2 seconds to enter the alarm time setting,the same operation mode and time settings. ADJ 1.When setting time,date,alarm,you can make the data increases,Press and hold the button to increase rapidly. 2.When displaying the alarm time (AL) mode,press the ADJ adjustable alarm off.(When Alarm function is turned on,the screen has a bell icon). MAX/MIN If you press MAX/MIN button once,our product will display the maximum indoor temperature and humidity during the whole detection,and if you press MAX/MIN button again,the minimum indoor temperature and humidity during the whole detection will be displayed. Backlight Press the“LIGHT”button once,it will start the luminous 5 seconds ℃/℉ The black key is located on the back of the meter.press the key of ℃/℉,you can choose to display temperature in Celsius or Fahrenheit.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MVuYIw75L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Telead","source_asin":"B07CMJYN43","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-150894","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CMJYN43","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CMJYN43","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
