window.products.push({"id":150944,"name":"WH23X10030 Washer Drain Pump Compatible with GE Hotpoint washer. Replaces AP5803461, PS8768445, WH23X10013, J27-769, WH23X0081, WH23X10003, WH23X91 an","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+fGknRHcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The WH23x10030 Drain Pump is a manufacturer-approved replacement drain pump for your washing machine. This pump helps expel water from the washing machine and is activated after the spin speed is maintained for a specific period of time. Works with name brands: General Electric. Replaces part numbers: AP5803461, PS8768445, WH23X0081, WH23X0091, WH23X0092, WH23X10003, WH23X10013, WH23X8081, WH23X81, WH23X91, WH23X92 and more Works with the following models: General Electric: 51451Y1WW, 51451Y2WW, 52120TAWB, 56021A0WW, 56031A0WW, 56041A0WW, 56051A0WW ... Fixes the following symptoms: If your washer is having any of these symptoms, then replacing the Drain Pump could solve your appliance problem. ◆ Washer will not drain ◆ Washer pumps but won’t spin ◆ Noisy cycles ◆ Washer leaks Instruction when replacement: The drain pump is located inside the washing machine, near the bottom. To access the drain pump for this repair, you will need to remove the front panel. Before you begin this repair, be sure that the power source is disconnected and the water source is shut off. The tools needed for this repair project is a putty knife, Phillips and flat blade screw driver, 1/4 inch nut driver, and needle nose pliers. 1.Disconnect all electrical & hydraulically net work for washing machine. 2.Empty all contents and also any inner water. 3.Disassemble the defective drain pump from impeller/filter/machine shaft include the electrical & Hydraulically connection. 4.Install with carefully at the same place the new Drain pump motor with also new gasket, the eventual bracket and protection for water. 5.Shut the screws to avoid clasp excessively so that not ruin the threads. 6.Repair the electrical & hydraulic connection for the drain pump, by verify and supervise the correct working of the machine","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+fGknRHcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Knob","source_asin":"B08J8BSW8D","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-150944","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08J8BSW8D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08J8BSW8D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
